8. Handling Pagination (Optional for Large Tenants)

If there are more users than can be retrieved in one call, handle pagination:

var users = await _graphClient.Users
    .Request()
    .Top(100)  // Get 100 users at a time
    .GetAsync();

while (users.NextPageRequest != null)
{
    users = await users.NextPageRequest.GetAsync();
}


---

9. Error Handling

Add error handling to manage exceptions:

try
{
    await _graphClient.Users[user.Id]
        .Request()
        .UpdateAsync(new User
        {
            UserPrincipalName = newUpn
        });
}
catch (ServiceException ex)
{
    Console.WriteLine($"Error updating {user.UserPrincipalName}: {ex.Message}");
}


